,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025 on that middle, August to September came in at 36% of normal and November to December at 47%. So far in 2026 on the middle, January to February sits at 41% of normal and May to June at 138%. Grid 22064 had its driest year in 1953 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
